&lt;h2 id=&#34;이-글은-kaggle의-binary-prediction-with-a-rainfall-dataset-경진대회를-다룹니다&#34;&gt;이 글은 Kaggle의 &amp;ldquo;Binary Prediction with a Rainfall Dataset&amp;rdquo; 경진대회를 다룹니다.&lt;/h2&gt;
